{"channelId":"UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","row":["RSPCA Radcliffe",462,"Our mission is to take in unwanted, abandoned, stray and mistreated animals and find them loving, permanent homes. We always make sure that all the animals in our shelter are given all the love and care they need before they are rehomed. We support the RSPCA Inspectors with their case and abandoned animals. We never compromise on animal welfare.\n\nEach year the RSPCA Radcliffe Animal Shelter cares for many hundreds of animals as they are brought in by RSPCA Inspectors or members of the public having been found abandoned, injured or as victims of cruelty and abuse. It costs the shelter over £500,000 a year to help local animals. All of our funds are raised locally from members of the public, companies and other organisations.","education@rspca-radcliffe.org.uk; info@rspca-radcliffe.org.uk","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:02.463Z","channelId":"UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"bfe46402ec887fe337f9cc92218772b4341721b313190a3196ecd1c765cfe07b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dc4b1ec24efbf8c069d918c21d5c84cb722266c60ee7ba58dcf47a2b6110a6a2"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:35:48.920Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":462,"raw":"462 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGU-43kWxkBSePFq__AvMTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:02.463Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"education@rspca-radcliffe.org.uk","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://rspca-radcliffe.org.uk/school-partnerships/"],"eviden